@model string
@*
    The server's clock, ticking (D65). Asterisk matches every open-hours check against this
    clock, so a condition that looks wrong is usually a clock that is wrong. A bare partial
    polled every five seconds - it swaps itself back in, so it must not drag the layout with
    it (a layout-wrapped poll response re-imports the poller in a tight loop).
*@
<span id="tc-server-time" class="font-monospace"
      hx-get="@Url.Page("Index", "Clock")" hx-trigger="every 5s" hx-swap="outerHTML"
      title="The clock every open-hours check is matched against">@Model</span>